#before android-pin 1234
# The phone, approved in flow 60, turns its vault on (设置 › 密钥 › 开启密钥库): the recovery words shown once, then its own
# vault, unlocked; then a token added to its library (e2e-token), agents let ask for it through the proxy to one host.
# The screen lock (a PIN, as a phone has) is what the box key is kept under.
#only android
timeout 120000
until 端到端测试
tap icon:settings
until =密钥
shot 0-settings
tap =密钥
until 开启密钥库
shot 1-off
tap =开启密钥库
until 抄写恢复码
shot 2-words
tap1 已抄写
# (the words gone as 已抄写 is pressed: they stayed up 20 s to a minute, or till something else built the page)
timeout 8000
until 已解锁，5 分钟后自动锁定
shot 3-on
timeout 120000
tap 全部密钥
until icon:plus
shot 4-all
tap icon:plus
until Token
shot 5-kinds
tap Token
until 添加密钥
shot 6-editor
# (the hosts first, under the fold while nothing is focused: once a field is, the system's keyboard takes the sheet's
# foot and the hosts' field lies under its buttons)
tap switch:允许 agent 申请
until 限定域名
wheel 300
tap api.github.com, *.example.com
type api.example.test
tap GitHub token
type e2e-token
tap ghp_
type e2e-secret-0123456789
shot 7-filled
tap =保存
gone 添加密钥
until e2e-token
shot 8-saved
